AddProduct x
⍝ Adds a new product to the inventory.
(name price qty sold)←x

:If 326≠⎕DR name
    ⎕←'Error: Product name must be text or enclosed.'

:ElseIf 2>≡name
    ⎕←'Error: Product must be enclosed⊂.'

:ElseIf price≤0
    ⎕←'Error: Price must be greater than zero.'

:ElseIf qty≤0
    ⎕←'Error: Quantity must be greater than zero.'

:ElseIf sold<0
    ⎕←'Error: Sold cannot be negative.'

:Else

    ItemName←ItemName,name
    Price←Price,price
    Quantity←Quantity,qty
    Sold←Sold,sold

    ⎕←'Product added successfully.'

:EndIf
